      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to use AWS S3 as the object storage provider for the `list_prefix.py` script. The next step is to make this choice explicit in the code. I am thinking of a clear way to reference it within the script.\n\n\n**Implementing the Provider**\n\nI'm now fully committed to AWS S3. The next logical step involves incorporating `boto3` into `list_prefix.py`. My focus is to create a function that efficiently lists objects by prefix within a designated bucket, making use of the AWS S3 client. Provider-specific details are next on my list to integrate.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789821212204,
          "start": 1789821210773
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a85095001jkBNxsHsWsZ2yr",
      "message_id": "msg_0b9a84c6b0017RGe4M2g7MCDjm",
